---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="關於我們">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <h1>關於 <span class="highlight">AI TalenTech Labs</span></h1>
      <p>我們相信，AI 時代最關鍵的競爭力不是技術本身，而是懂得運用 AI 的人才。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="founder-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-visual">
          <div class="founder-photo-about">
            <img src="/images/founder.jpg" alt="廖肇弘博士 Dr. John Liao" width="530" height="800" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="founder-links">
            <a href="https://portaly.cc/aied-lab/tab/johnliao" target="_blank" class="founder-link">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
              Portaly
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/johnliontw" target="_blank" class="founder-link">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
              LinkedIn
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/johnliontw/" target="_blank" class="founder-link">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
              Facebook
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-info">
          <span class="section-label">Founder</span>
          <h2>廖肇弘 博士</h2>
          <h3>Dr. John Liao</h3>

          <div class="founder-titles">
            <p>AI TalenTech Labs 創辦人</p>
            <p>AI 人才科技研訓院 院長</p>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-bio">
            <p>擁有 28 年以上的數位人才發展與 AI 策略經驗。曾任工研院產業學院數位訓練長，長期投入政府與企業的 AI 人才培育與數位轉型工作，累計培訓超過 99,000 名學員、服務 386 家以上企業機構，教學時數超過 19,800 小時。</p>
            <p>專精於系統思考方法論、企業 AI 轉型策略、以及 AI 模擬教練系統的研發。致力於以「人才科技」（TalenTech）的創新理念，打造 AI 時代的人才發展新典範。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-exp">
            <h4>主要經歷</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>行政院人總 + 數發部 AI 公務人才發展辦公室 PMO 執行長</li>
              <li>行政院人事行政總處 AI 政府領航人才發展計畫主持人</li>
              <li>數發部 政府數位人才培育計畫｜數位職能及 AI 應用計畫主持人</li>
              <li>經濟部 DIGI⁺Talent 跨域數位人才加速躍升計畫主持人</li>
              <li>工研院 產業學院 數位訓練長</li>
              <li>國立清華大學 教育學院 兼任教授</li>
              <li>CIO 資訊長雜誌專欄作家｜CIO 協進會 AI 顧問群總召集人</li>
              <li>Microsoft、IBM、PwC 等多家世界 500 強企業顧問</li>
              <li>50+ 政府機關社群媒體顧問</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-awards">
            <h4>榮譽與獎項</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>ATD 全球人才發展創新大獎</li>
              <li>Horizon、HundrED100 等多項全球大獎</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-stats">
            <div class="f-stat">
              <span class="f-stat-number">28+</span>
              <span class="f-stat-label">專業年資</span>
            </div>
            <div class="f-stat">
              <span class="f-stat-number">386+</span>
              <span class="f-stat-label">培訓企業</span>
            </div>
            <div class="f-stat">
              <span class="f-stat-number">99,000+</span>
              <span class="f-stat-label">培訓學員</span>
            </div>
            <div class="f-stat">
              <span class="f-stat-number">19,800+</span>
              <span class="f-stat-label">教學時數</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mission-grid">
        <div class="card mission-card">
          <h3>使命 Mission</h3>
          <p>以 AI 科技賦能人才發展，讓每一個組織都能培養出駕馭 AI 的未來人才。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card mission-card">
          <h3>願景 Vision</h3>
          <p>成為亞太地區最具影響力的 AI 人才科技研究與應用機構。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card mission-card">
          <h3>價值 Values</h3>
          <p>創新驅動、以人為本、系統思維、知行合一。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .founder-section {
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .founder-photo-about {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }
  .founder-photo-about img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .founder-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .founder-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .founder-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }
  .founder-info h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .founder-info h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .founder-titles p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
  }
  .founder-bio {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .founder-bio p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .founder-exp,
  .founder-awards {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .founder-exp h4,
  .founder-awards h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .founder-exp ul,
  .founder-awards ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .founder-exp li,
  .founder-awards li {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .founder-exp li::before,
  .founder-awards li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.7rem;
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .founder-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .f-stat {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .f-stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .f-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .mission-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .mission-card p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .founder-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .founder-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .mission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
